  sources:
  - name: Longmont 2021 GHG Inventory (30 Jan 2023)
    authority: City of Longmont (inventory workbook created by Julia Ferguson)
    url:
    description: 'The 2021 community inventory, with years back to 2016 on the Year
      over Year sheet. Origin of the historical sector emissions (Year over Year),
      the GWPs, the waste emission factors, the transit share and the 2021-era fuel
      and vehicle factors. Sent by Francie Jaffe (City of Longmont); the date is when
      the file was last saved, which approximates when Kausal received it. A second
      copy with the same name but different bytes is at the top of the Drive folder
      (saved 2023-02-10). Years covered: 2016-2021.; Attachment: client/Longmont (CO)
      Client/KP material/FINAL_Longmont_2021_GHG_Inventory_01302023.xlsx; Format:
      .xlsx; Geographic Coverage: City of Longmont, Colorado; Date Last Updated: 2023-03-16;
      Updated by: Jouni Tuomisto (register row drafted by Claude, 2026-11-21)'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Longmont Paths Data Template (Feb 2025, city-filled)
    authority: City of Longmont (last saved by Francie Jaffe, 2025-02-13); 
      template generated by Kausal
    url:
    description: "A template that Kausal generated from the model's data (2024-07-19).
      In February 2025 the city filled it in, on the 'Data - Kausal', 'Data Comparison',
      'New Proposal' and 'Stationary Emissions' sheets. It is the route by which several
      2023-era datasets were updated, but the origin of each value is the inventory
      or the scenario model. Sent by Francie Jaffe (City of Longmont); the date is
      when the file was last saved, which approximates when Kausal received it. Years
      covered: 2016-2050.; Attachment: client/Longmont (CO) Client/2025 Paths Update/From
      Longmont_s Sharepoint Folder 020242025/Longmont Paths Data Template.xlsx; Format:
      .xlsx; Geographic Coverage: City of Longmont, Colorado; Date Last Updated: 2025-02-13;
      Updated by: Jouni Tuomisto (register row drafted by Claude, 2026-11-21)"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  dataset:
    time_resolution: yearly
    is_editable: true
  index_columns:
  - energy_carrier
  - emission_sectors
  - Year
  updated_at: '1795523496'
  units:
